  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ybris.nauck1889grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ybris.nauck1889grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ybris"><head>ΥΒΡΙΣ ΣΑΤΥΡΙΚΗ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="609" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ybris" xml:id="fragment-ybris-nauck1889grc1-609">
            <head>609</head>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">λήθην τε τὴν πάντ’ ἀπεστερημένην</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">κωφὴν ἄναυδον</l>
            </lg>
            <p>Stob. Flor. 26 , 3 : Σοφοκλέους Ὕβρεως σατύρου (sic MA, σατύρου
om. S) . ‘λήθην — ἄναυδον’ . v. 1 τὴν πάντ’ SMA, <add>καὶ</add> τὴν
πάντ’ Gesner, τὴν ἅπαντ’ Wagner, τὴν <add>τὰ</add> πάντ’ Gomperz.</p>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="610" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ybris" xml:id="fragment-ybris-nauck1889grc1-610">
            <head>610</head>
            <lg>
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">ἐσθίειν ἐθέλων τὸν δέλφακα</l>
            </lg>
            <p>Ath. XIV p. 657 A : δέλφακα δὲ ἀρσενικῶς εἴρηκε — Σοφοκλῆς
Ὕβρει ‘ἐσθίειν — δέλφακα’ . θέλων probabiliter coni. Dindorf.</p>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
